  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><span><img alt=\"New\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>This page talks about <b>new  things</b>. As such, there may be inaccurate or missing information. What you see here may change over time.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Worm_Treats.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180308\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Worm Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Worm Treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Worm Treats</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>halloweenh</span><span title=\"Halloween hat\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"halloweenh\"><img alt=\"halloweenh\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20241021192419\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  15m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 45</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Halloween Treats Maker</span><span title=\"Halloween treats maker\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/halloween-treats-maker-36156\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 15</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Worm Treats</b> are a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 20. It's a special item used only for the Halloween event.\nIn 2025, they are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 35.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Worm Treats</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Halloween_Treats_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180133\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Halloween Treats Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Worm Treats are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-treats-maker-36156\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Treats Maker</a>.\n</p><p>To make worm treats, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/apple-2241\" title=\"Apple\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Apple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/popcorn-2092\" title=\"Popcorn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Popcorn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Indigo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 15 minutes to make treats. Each treats gives players 45 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>To make a worm treat in the <b>Halloween 2025 event</b>, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/soft-candy-36442\" title=\"Soft Candy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soft Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-pie-2089\" title=\"Carrot Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make one treat, and 5 minutes in a 1-star mastered station. Each treat gives players 80 experience points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 treats per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each treats used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-hat-36167\" title=\"Halloween Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Hats</a>, 11 halloween hats in a 1-star and mastered maker, 14 halloween hats in a 2-star and 20 halloween hats in a 3-star.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-halloween-treats-maker-products-36166\" title=\"Category:Halloween Treats Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Treats Maker Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-treats-36174\" title=\"Pumpkin Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin Treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/skull-treats-36172\" title=\"Skull Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Skull Treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/teeth-treats-36170\" title=\"Teeth Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Teeth Treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/worm-treats-36171\" title=\"Worm Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Worm Treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831170418\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 991/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5090/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 653/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766203/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   73.986      1 -total\n 68.44%   50.638      1 Template:Infobox\n 27.06%   20.021      6 Template:Infoicon\n 17.73%   13.121      1 Template:Navigation\n  9.32%    6.894      1 Template:HalloweenTreatsMakerMenu\n  5.62%    4.161      1 Template:New\n  3.04%    2.248      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  2.69%    1.991      1 Template:MessageBox\n  2.48%    1.838      1 Template:Languages\n  1.83%    1.351      3 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36171-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831170418 and revision id 108791. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
